    "detailed_description": "Play as an existing or fully customisable political figure, and campaign for the Australian federal elections of 2025 or many other alternative elections! In &quot;<strong>Vox Populi: Australia 2025</strong>&quot;, you and the characters around you must promote your ideas and your popularity throughout the country to claim victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/d29af4c53c3c153d41e9f07bdabbaa0e.poster.avif?t=1750347445\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/d29af4c53c3c153d41e9f07bdabbaa0e.webm?t=1750347445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/d29af4c53c3c153d41e9f07bdabbaa0e.mp4?t=1750347445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose from a host of different scenarios that place the country in various realistic or fictional situations on different dates. <br></li><li>Recruit your campaign team from a variety of characters, based on their ideologies or traits.<br></li><li>Act directly on your nation's regions or demographic groups to impact their political opinions and voting intentions.<br></li><li>Adapt your strategy to the actions of your opponents and place obstacles in their path.<br></li><li>Face the many unforeseen events that will shake up the country's political life.<br></li><li>Influence and organise national referendums to change voting rules, territorial integrity or laws that directly benefit you.<br></li><li>Collect enough seats in the future House of Representatives to ensure your influence on the nation's destiny.<br></li><li>Collect dozens of cards that will help you in the great national debates.<br></li><li>Play as an alien or a defender of humanity in a variety of fictional science fiction scenarios.<br></li><li>Organise speeches to the populations of post-apocalyptic scenario worlds to gain supreme power.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/916d6dae42b96a2ef925156062a55d0e.poster.avif?t=1750347445\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/916d6dae42b96a2ef925156062a55d0e.webm?t=1750347445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/916d6dae42b96a2ef925156062a55d0e.mp4?t=1750347445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>This game includes:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 different scenarios, past or future, many with randomisation for replayability, adapted to the country's history and politics<br></li><li>Science fiction or post-apocalyptic scenarios with their own characters, regions, traits, ideologies, corpuses and events<br></li><li>A detailed, fully customisable character creator<br></li><li>Dozens of pre-existing or randomly generated characters<br></li><li>Dozens of unique ideologies and corpuses<br></li><li>A realistic subdivision of Australia into regions and demographic categories, each with its own characteristics<br></li><li>Flexible character actions that allow for a wide variety of gameplay<br></li><li>120 unique events<br></li><li>Dozens of character traits that influence their actions or debates<br></li><li>50 varied cards for dynamic debates between characters<br></li><li>80 possible referendums, fundamentally influencing gameplay or providing various advantages to candidates<br></li><li>A unique system of parliament and political coalitions based on the ideologies of each candidate<br></li><li>Detailed collections of data and statistics to track the evolution of the electorate and your campaign<br></li><li>And much more to discover!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/03e02a7b616fc764e4f4e756706dc2a8.poster.avif?t=1750347445\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/03e02a7b616fc764e4f4e756706dc2a8.webm?t=1750347445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539270/extras/03e02a7b616fc764e4f4e756706dc2a8.mp4?t=1750347445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
